Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 21:33:51 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 19/52] Create profile: default name, AddXboxLive paths as
 createprofile.xex does

- vk's highlighted default text: PlayerN (first unused), brush
  0x64B0DCAB; a character/Backspace replaces it, cursor keys keep it;
  the keyboard reopens with the name after an error or Back.
- All three Save Gamer Profile buttons save the profile and sign it in on
  the controller that created it (XamUserLogon); Join Xbox Live then asks
  once (retail flags 0x4) and shows Can't Connect, Test Connection ->
  Exit Session; Cancel/No go back to Save Gamer Profile.
- XCONFIG_USER_RETAIL_FLAGS is kept (cvar retail_flags, saved on
  ExSetXConfigSetting).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
